:artwork_20260103_151301_825 rdf:type arto:Artwork ;
    dcterms:title "Artwork 20260103 151301 825"@en ;
    dcterms:description """A Baroque painting depicting a bright and cheerful afternoon scene with harsh natural sunlight streaming through a window. In the foreground, a small, polished fork with warm silver tones and golden highlights rests atop a medium-sized glass jar. The jar is made of clear amber glass that catches prismatic highlights, appearing clean and sealed. Beside the jar sits a medium-sized handbag in warm brown leather with golden brass hardware, showing signs of being well-used but carefully maintained. The objects are arranged on a wooden surface, with dramatic Baroque lighting creating strong contrasts between illuminated areas and deep shadows, capturing the active, cheerful atmosphere of the afternoon."""@en ;
    arto:style aat:300021147 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-01-03T15:13:28.963923"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "AI Artwork Generation System" ;
    arto:medium arto:DigitalMedium .

